<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;">You are receiving this email as one of the Inactive Account&nbsp; that you marked for promotion is rejected by the&nbsp;<em>Lead Team</em>. Please see the details below.</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Inactive Account Id -&nbsp;</span></font></b><font face="Verdana"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><b>{!Account.AccountID__c}</b></span></font></p><p style=""><b><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Inactive Account Name</span></font></b><font style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Times New Roman"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><a href="https://monster--training.cs92.my.salesforce.com/p/email/template/EmailTemplateEditorUi/{!Account.Link}">{!Account.Name}</a></span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Inactive Account</span></font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;Sales Channel</span></font></b><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">{!Account.SalesChannel__c}</font><br></span></font><b style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Inactive Account</span></font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;Sales Rep</span></font></b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Account.OwnerFullName}</span></font><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Reason for&nbsp;Rejection -&nbsp;</span></font></b><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">This lead is not promoted because:</font></span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><br></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><b><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Other Comments:</span></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><b><font face="Verdana" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><br></span></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Verdana" color="#ff6633" size="2"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt;"><em><u>Please Note:</u>&nbsp;<br></em></span></font></p><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><em style=""><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><i><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><em></em></span></i></b><span style="font-family: Arial;"><o:p style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><b style="color: navy;"><i><font face="Verdana" color="#ff6633" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">1)&nbsp;<em><i><font face="Verdana">To resend this lead for promotion, please check the 'reason for rejection' and update the&nbsp;</font></i></em></span></font></i></b><b style="font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2" style="" color="#ff6600"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Inactive Account</span></font></b><b style="color: navy;"><i><font face="Verdana" color="#ff6633" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><em><i><font face="Verdana">&nbsp;on SF and mark it 'Ready' for promotion<br></font></i></em></span></font></i></b><b style="color: navy;"><i><font face="Verdana" color="#ff6633" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">2) Promotion request cannot be resend if&nbsp;</span></font></i></b><b style="font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2" style="" color="#ff6600"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Inactive Account</span></font></b><b style="color: navy;"><i><font face="Verdana" color="#ff6633" size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;"Already exists in Accounts" or "Do not meet addition parameters"<br><em><i><font face="Verdana">3) No Action will be taken if correction request is send by email</font></i></em></span></font></i></b></p></o:p></span></em></font>]]></td>
</tr>
